pe\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926694452\",\"position\":1,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926694452\",\"name\":\"1. What is Artificial Intelligence?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Artificial Intelligence is\u00a0technology\u00a0that allows computers and machines to perform tasks that normally require human thinking, such as learning from data, recognizing patterns, understanding language, and making decisions.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926705427\",\"position\":2,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926705427\",\"name\":\"2. What are the main types of AI?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"AI is\u00a0generally grouped\u00a0into Narrow AI, which handles specific tasks like voice assistants; General AI, a theoretical form that could match human intelligence across any task; and Super AI, a hypothetical stage where machines would exceed human intelligence entirely.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926804109\",\"position\":3,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926804109\",\"name\":\"3. Is AI the same as machine learning?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Machine learning is a subset of AI. AI is the broader concept of machines mimicking human intelligence, while machine learning specifically refers to systems that learn from data rather than following fixed rules.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926818056\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926818056\",\"name\":\"4. Will AI replace human jobs?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"AI will change many jobs rather than simply erasing them. Research from the World Economic Forum projects that while 92 million jobs may be displaced by 2030, around 170 million new roles are also expected to be created, resulting in a net increase in global employment.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926832823\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926832823\",\"name\":\"5. How can a beginner start learning AI?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Beginners can start by learning the basics of <a href=\\\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/python\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\">Python programming<\/a>, exploring free introductory courses on machine learning, and practicing with beginner-friendly AI tools to understand how prompts, data, and models work together before moving into more advanced topics.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926848089\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926848089\",\"name\":\"6. What is the difference between AI and\u00a0automation?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Automation follows fixed, pre-programmed rules to complete repetitive tasks, while artificial intelligence can learn from data and adjust its behavior over time. A simple automated system will do the same thing every time, but an AI system can improve its output as it sees more examples.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926864067\",\"position\":7,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926864067\",\"name\":\"7. Can AI think and feel like\u00a0humans?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Current AI systems can process language, recognize patterns, and generate responses that sound human, but they do not have consciousness, emotions, or genuine understanding. This kind of human-like thinking falls under General AI, which does not exist yet.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926878924\",\"position\":8,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926878924\",\"name\":\"8. What skills are needed to work in artificial intelligence?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A career in AI usually starts with Python programming, basic statistics, and an understanding of data structures. From there, most people move into machine learning concepts, working with data, and eventually specialize in areas like NLP, computer vision, or AI engineering.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926893992\",\"position\":9,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926893992\",\"name\":\"9. Is artificial intelligence safe to use?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"AI is\u00a0generally safe\u00a0when built and used responsibly, but it carries real risks like data bias, privacy concerns, and overreliance without human oversight. Following good artificial intelligence ethics practices, such as transparency and regular auditing, helps reduce these risks.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926910588\",\"position\":10,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926910588\",\"name\":\"10. How is generative AI different from traditional AI?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Traditional AI is usually built to classify, predict, or recommend based on existing data, such as flagging fraud or suggesting a product. Generative AI goes a step further by creating\u00a0new content, including text, images, audio, and video, based on patterns it has learned.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926925100\",\"position\":11,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926925100\",\"name\":\"11. What industries use artificial intelligence the most?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Healthcare, finance, marketing, retail, and education currently show some of the highest AI adoption rates. Manufacturing and\u00a0logistics\u00a0are also growing quickly, especially for predictive maintenance and supply chain optimization.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/#faq-question-1785926939391\",\"posi